        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9010/203, Modern Rectangular 8 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose from 6 different popular finishes for this 8 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Pull. The Modern Rectangular 8 Inch Cabinet Handle is great to update any kitchen. The contemporary design paired with the modern finishes makes for one beautiful cabinet door pull that is very now. It is 10 inches long with a 8 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9010\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9010 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sold Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
