                "title": "8 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "This 8 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Pull is great for any kitchen remodel. The modern design is paired with some of the most popular finishes in the industry for a look that is sophisticated and timeless. Shop cabinet hardware at Doorware.com today!",
